          "audioUrl": "audio/haze_match_start_haze_tengu_convo01_01.mp3",
          "text": "You did good things for the city, you should feel proud.",
          "duration": 4.222
        },
        {
          "order": 2,
          "character": "Ivy",
          "audioFile": "tengu_match_start_haze_tengu_convo01_02",
          "audioUrl": "audio/tengu_match_start_haze_tengu_convo01_02.mp3",
          "text": "Anyone would have done the same.",
          "duration": 1.799
        },
        {
          "order": 3,
          "character": "Haze",
          "audioFile": "haze_match_start_haze_tengu_convo01_03",
          "audioUrl": "audio/haze_match_start_haze_tengu_convo01_03.mp3",
          "text": "No they wouldn't.  That's why it took you to do it.",
          "duration": 3.542
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "conversationId": "haze_ivy_convo02",
      "lines": [
        {
          "order": 1,
          "character": "Ivy",
          "audioFile": "tengu_match_start_haze_tengu_convo02_01",
          "audioUrl": "audio/tengu_match_start_haze_tengu_convo02_01.mp3",
          "text": "Ms. Haze, do you think I'd be a good fit for the OSIC?",
          "duration": 3.736
        },
        {
          "order": 2,
          "character": "Haze",
          "audioFile": "haze_match_start_haze_tengu_convo02_02",
          "audioUrl": "audio/haze_match_start_haze_tengu_convo02_02.mp3",
          "text": "No.",
          "duration": 1.539
        },
        {
          "order": 3,
          "character": "Ivy",
          "audioFile": "tengu_match_start_haze_tengu_convo02_03",
          "audioUrl": "audio/tengu_match_start_haze_tengu_convo02_03.mp3",
          "text": "Really?  Why.",
          "duration": 1.69
        },
        {
          "order": 4,
          "character": "Haze",
          "audioFile": "haze_match_start_haze_tengu_convo02_04",
          "audioUrl": "audio/haze_match_start_haze_tengu_convo02_04.mp3",
          "text": "You have a big heart.",
          "duration": 2.084
        },
        {
          "order": 5,
          "character": "Ivy",
          "audioFile": "tengu_match_start_haze_tengu_convo02_05",
          "audioUrl": "audio/tengu_match_start_haze_tengu_convo02_05.mp3",
          "text": "That's not a bad thing.",
          "duration": 1.584
        },
        {
          "order": 6,
          "character": "Haze",
          "audioFile": "haze_match_start_haze_tengu_convo02_06",
          "audioUrl": "audio/haze_match_start_haze_tengu_convo02_06.mp3",
          "text": "Of course not.  But it means the bad days would stay with you.  And in our line of work you can't let it.",
          "duration": 6.7
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "conversationId": "haze_ivy_convo03",
      "lines": [
        {
          "order": 1,
          "character": "Ivy",
          "audioFile": "tengu_match_start_haze_tengu_convo03_01",
          "audioUrl": "audio/tengu_match_start_haze_tengu_convo03_01.mp3",
          "text": "How often do you work with a partner?",
          "duration": 2.452
        },
        {
          "order": 2,
          "character": "Haze",
          "audioFile": "haze_match_start_haze_tengu_convo03_02",
          "audioUrl": "audio/haze_match_start_haze_tengu_convo03_02.mp3",
          "text": "Assassination is rarely a team sport.",
          "duration": 3.3
        },
        {
          "order": 3,
          "character": "Ivy",
          "audioFile": "tengu_match_start_haze_tengu_convo03_03",
          "audioUrl": "audio/tengu_match_start_haze_tengu_convo03_03.mp3",
          "text": "Well, stick with me.  If you let me help you we can make a lot happen.",
          "duration": 4.623
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
